### Increment/Decrement Operators

```c
int x = 5;

// Post-increment (use value, then increment)
int y = x++;               // y = 5, x = 6

// Pre-increment (increment, then use value)
int z = ++x;               // z = 7, x = 7

// Similar for decrement
int a = x--;               // a = 7, x = 6
int b = --x;               // b = 5, x = 5

// In loops
for (int i = 0; i < 10; i++) {
    // i is incremented after each iteration
}
```

### Ternary Operator

```c
// condition ? true_value : false_value
int age = 20;
